s he lost control of his  vision for his career  but now justin says he hopes he can take  the lessons he learned during the hard  times in his life  and help others avoid that pain i don't  want to let my shame of my past  dictate what i'm able to do now for  people it's an amazing feeling  but despite his troubled past today  justin says  he is at peace  [Music]  i have a wife who i adore who i feel  comforted by  i feel safe i feel like my relationship  with god is wonderful  i believe that at this point in my life  i'm right where i'm supposed to be  doing what i believe that god wants me  to do and there's  nothing more fulfilling  you
 

